        "type": "Passive",
        "description": "When in [Bestial Fury] state, increases Attack based on Phantasio's Max Sanity. Phantasio gains [Immersion] by using skills, with the [Immersion] cap equal to Phantasio's Max Sanity. Using [Recitativo] or [Aria] gains a certain amount of [Immersion]; when in [Bestial Fury] state, continuously gains [Immersion] per second. When [Immersion] reaches its maximum in [Bestial Fury] state, Phantasio enters [Bestial Fury: Devotion] state.[Bestial Fury: Devotion]: When in [Bestial Fury: Devotion] state, continuously consumes [Immersion] instead of Sanity to maintain the [Bestial Fury] state and increases Movement Speed, Skill Speed and ATK based on Phantasio's Max Sanity. When in [Bestial Fury: Devotion] state, prevents [Immersion] gain from sustaining Beast Form.",
